cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the AI Companion Emotional Connection Benchmark, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "AI Companion Emotional Connection Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  An open benchmark that defines emotional connection in AI characters and
  companions as eight observable behaviors (listening, emotional attunement,
  curiosity and follow-through, calibrated validation, conversational
  continuity, character consistency, emotional range, and respect for user
  agency) and provides test cases, 0-5 rubrics, a failure-mode taxonomy and
  scoring tools for evaluating them in everyday, SFW conversation.
type: dataset
authors:
